From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:26:12 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Read events per page and max capacity from .env

Add Lib\Config::int() to read an integer from $_ENV with a default and
an allowed range (digits only), Validations::integerMax(), and use them
for EVENTS_PER_PAGE (1-100, default 5) in the admin events listing and
MAX_CAPACITY (1-100000, default 1000) in Event::validates().
